"""T50 frozen rule table (G0-lite T50 section 3, FIX-1..FIX-5, Round 2 R2-T50-a..e).

The table is data (hashed: RULE_TABLE.sha). It carries the Tier-source column (FIX-5): each non-ALLOW rule names
the Claude Code auto-mode-config category its soft/hard tier comes from, or PLANNER CHOICE. The stripped excerpt
quotes no entry list, so "entry id pending L-0" cells stay until L-0 attaches the list (K20).

GAP-FILLS (GF-n): places where the approved G0-lite is silent and the build had to choose. Each is marked in
the row `gap_fill` and listed in GAP_FILLS for the Opus re-check; none changes a rule the G0-lite states.
GF1-GF13, R16_SCOPE and HOOK_WRITES carry the Opus ruling sentences word for word (RULINGS_T50_GF.md, 18 Oct 2026;
copy in families/T50/G0_ADDENDUM_GF.md). Card slots shift only the rules the text marks for them: the hook-policy and
digest-pin slots carry one fixed value on all 8 cards and shift no label.
"""
